2DA V1.0
*
# ethren (M3.4): the occupation skill tags (docs/rules/funnel.md, "Ethren design proposal: occupation skills"),
# rows in the order of the OCCU record's bits (DCC::OccupationSkill, ANIMALS bit 0 .. COOKING bit 29). ABILITY is
# the tag's default ability (a check that asks for DEFAULT), FAMILIAR the tags that give some familiarity
# (d10 + 2, the book's "miller knows a little about seeds"), THIEF the Table 1-9 skill the tag overlaps (a thief
# of level 1+ adds its bonus there), CAP the highest DC occupation training reaches in it (classes.md: a
# locksmith who isn't a thief picks simple locks trained, up to DC 10; d10 + 2 past it). NAME and USES are what
# the record sheet shows; _ for spaces, * for none.
                 ABILITY  FAMILIAR                          THIEF        CAP  NAME             USES
ANIMALS          PER      OUTDOORS|FARMING|BUTCHERY         *            *    Animals          handling,_riding,_calming_beasts
FARMING          INT      HERBALISM|ANIMALS|COOKING         *            *    Farming          crops,_seeds,_weather,_soil
HERBALISM        INT      FARMING|MEDICINE|ALCHEMY|OUTDOORS *            *    Herbalism        plants,_poultices,_poisons_from_plants
MEDICINE         INT      HERBALISM|BUTCHERY|ALCHEMY        *            *    Medicine         wounds,_disease
ALCHEMY          INT      HERBALISM|MEDICINE|LORE_ARCANE    *            *    Alchemy          reagents,_oils,_acids
SMITHING         STR      MINING|LOCKS|MILITARY             *            *    Smithing         metal,_weapons,_armor_quality
MASONRY          INT      MINING|DIGGING|CARPENTRY          *            *    Masonry          stone,_construction,_structural_weakness
CARPENTRY        AGI      MASONRY|CRAFT_FINE                *            *    Carpentry        wood,_barrels,_carts,_doors
MINING           INT      MASONRY|DIGGING|SMITHING          *            *    Mining           tunnels,_ore,_cave-ins,_underground_direction
CRAFT_FINE       AGI      APPRAISAL|CARPENTRY               *            *    Craft_(fine)     jewelry,_glass,_clothing,_leather
APPRAISAL        INT      HAGGLE|CRAFT_FINE|SMITHING        *            *    Appraisal        the_value_of_goods,_gems,_art
HAGGLE           PER      APPRAISAL|DECEPTION               *            *    Haggling         trade,_prices,_bargaining
LOCKS            AGI      SMITHING|CARPENTRY|STEALTH_STREET PICK_LOCK    10   Locks            simple_locks,_mechanisms
STEALTH_STREET   AGI      DECEPTION|LOCKS                   PICK_POCKET  10   Street_stealth   pickpocketing,_cons,_urban_sneaking
DECEPTION        PER      STEALTH_STREET|PERFORMANCE|HAGGLE *            *    Deception        lies,_disguise,_gambling_tells
PERFORMANCE      PER      DECEPTION|NOBILITY                *            *    Performance      music,_jest,_distraction
LORE_RELIGION    INT      LORE_ARCANE|LETTERS               *            *    Religion         gods,_rites,_holy_symbols
LORE_ARCANE      INT      LORE_RELIGION|LORE_STARS|ALCHEMY  *            *    Arcana           magic_writing,_sigils,_grimoires
LORE_STARS       INT      LORE_ARCANE|SEA                   *            *    Stars            astrology,_navigation_by_stars,_calendars
LETTERS          INT      LORE_ARCANE|NOBILITY              *            *    Letters          reading,_writing,_documents,_law
NOBILITY         PER      LETTERS|MILITARY|PERFORMANCE      *            *    Nobility         etiquette,_heraldry,_courts
MILITARY         INT      NOBILITY|SMITHING|OUTDOORS        *            *    Military         tactics,_ranks,_fortifications,_drill
OUTDOORS         INT      ANIMALS|HERBALISM|CLIMB           *            *    Outdoors         tracking,_hunting,_foraging,_trapping
SEA              STR      ROPE|CLIMB|LORE_STARS             *            *    Sea              boats,_swimming,_knots,_weather_at_sea
CLIMB            STR      ROPE|OUTDOORS|SEA                 CLIMB        *    Climbing         trees,_rigging,_cliffs
DIGGING          STR      MINING|MASONRY|FILTH              *            *    Digging          excavation,_graves,_ditches
FILTH            STA      DIGGING|MEDICINE                  *            *    Filth            sewers,_middens,_night_soil,_avoiding_disease
BUTCHERY         INT      COOKING|ANIMALS|MEDICINE          *            *    Butchery         anatomy,_meat,_carcasses
ROPE             AGI      SEA|CLIMB                         *            *    Rope             rope_work,_knots,_rigging
COOKING          INT      BUTCHERY|FARMING                  *            *    Cooking          food,_brewing,_cheese,_honey
